{
	"_doc": "Items of a run (src/items/inventory.gd, item_rules.gd; design docs/GEGENSTAENDE.de.md). Every hero starts with the common weapon marked start for their class. Weapons are class-bound (class), have a fixed rarity, a sprite (below res://assets/sprites/), base values that replace the class weapon (damage per hit, interval = seconds between attacks, reach and arc for melee, speed/life/splash for shots) and effects: perk effects from balance.json perks (cinder = burns, venom = poison, frost = slows, storm = chain lightning, crit = crit chance, piercer, split, homing, twin, blast, overkill, vampire, leech, execution, mark, first_strike, combustion, plague, permafrost, shatter ...). Found weapons are unidentified: name unknown_name, effects and curse hidden; curse_chance of them carry a curse. Equipping identifies; a cursed weapon then sticks until a curse-breaker stone breaks it, and the curse becomes its blessing. Potions look only like their colour until identified (identification crystal, or drinking or throwing one: the whole team learns that colour for the run); colours are shuffled per run. drops: chance per source (crate, chest, mimic, gold_crate) and what kind; rarity weights interpolate from floor 1 (first) to floor 10 (second). bag: slots of the backpack. ITEM SYSTEM 2 (docs/ITEM-SYSTEM-V2.de.md): gear = armour, ring and amulet (slot), found like weapons (unknown, curse_by_slot chance, the same curses except burning_blade), stats in shares (damage, rate = faster attacks, speed, cooldown: negative = faster) and max_hp in HP (2 = one heart), effects like weapons; stage: every weapon and gear piece has a stage from min to max, rolled around mean (mean_cursed when cursed) with spread, shown once known; values grow by per_stage per stage (per_stage_less for attack pauses); consumables: clone_seal (a clone fights for clone_time s, clone_time_rare for the rare one), upgrade_stone (+1 stage; on a cursed piece fail_chance it loses a stage instead), dice_stone (rerolls the stage), mirror_crystal (reveals every potion in the bag). per_floor: fixed finds on every floor (crystal each floor, stone every stone_every floors); mini guardians drop gear or a weapon of min_rarity.",
